# Disiplin kode (R1)

SoT lengkap: `product-discovery/06-engineering/code-discipline.md`. Astryx CLI: `.cursor/rules/xds.mdc`. **Kerja baru** ikut ini; jangan rewrite besar `app/` lama di task yang sama.

## Spacing

- **`gap`** = jarak antar anak `VStack`/`HStack`/`Grid`. **`padding`** = inset dalam container. **Bukan** `margin` di tiap sibling.
- Step Astryx: `gap={2}` rapat; `gap={3}` kicker+judul; `gap={8}` isi section. `padding={0}` di `Section` jika ritme halaman ada di CSS scoped (`.home-container`).
- Token `var(--spacing-*)` di `globals.css`. Bukan `p-[13px]`, bukan hex di JSX.

```tsx
// pakai
<Section variant="transparent" padding={0} className="home-section">
  <VStack className="home-container" gap={8}>
    <VStack gap={3}>
      <Text type="label">{kicker}</Text>
      <Heading level={2}>{title}</Heading>
    </VStack>
  </VStack>
</Section>

// jangan
<div style={{ marginBottom: 32 }}><Heading>{title}</Heading></div>
```

## Styling

1. Props Astryx → 2. `VStack`/`HStack`/`Grid`/`Section`/`AppShell` → 3. `className` scoped + `app/globals.css` (token) → 4. `lib/astryx-theme.ts`.
- **`xstyle` / `stylex.create()` dilarang** sampai compiler StyleX di-wire ke Turbopack (T-013.4, build gagal; ADR-018).
- Tidak ada Tailwind. Tidak ada `<div>` hanya untuk spasi. `style={{}}` layout/warna dilarang (`colorScheme` di `<html>` = pengecualian yang sudah ada).

## Server / client / `"use server"`

- Default = Server Component. Route `page.tsx`/`layout.tsx` **tetap server** (`generateStaticParams`, metadata).
- `"use client"` hanya untuk hook, event, context, Lenis, overlay. Bukan karena impor Astryx — lihat `stub-page.tsx` / `overlay-icons.tsx`.
- `"use server"` = Server Action. **Tidak ada di R1** (Contact = `mailto:` + form klien). Jangan taruh di page.

```tsx
// pakai — about/page.tsx server, island klien diimpor
export default async function AboutRoute({ params }: PageProps<"/[locale]/about">) {
  const { locale } = await params;
  return <AboutPage locale={locale} />;
}

// jangan — "use client" di page.tsx; atau "use server" di page
```

## Render Next.js

- Bentuk: SSG + `content/` + `generateStaticParams` locale (ADR-015).
- `cookies()` Next **hanya** di `app/layout.tsx` untuk tema (`rz-theme`). Locale `/`: `proxy.ts` baca `NEXT_LOCALE` + header geo/`Accept-Language` (ADR-014) — jangan hapus. Jangan tambah `cookies()`/`headers()` di route halaman locale.
- ISR, `loading.tsx`/streaming, `revalidate`, `force-dynamic` **bukan** default R1. Ubah bentuk → ADR baru.
